---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const itemSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "Dilly Bar",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/dilly-bar.webp",
      "description": "Round DQ soft serve on a stick coated in a crispy chocolate shell. The original DQ novelty bar since 1955 — and at $1.99, the best-value frozen treat on the entire menu.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "1.99",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
        "url": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/items/dilly-bar"
      },
      "nutrition": {
        "@type": "NutritionInformation",
        "calories": "Chocolate 210 cal · Non-Dairy 220 cal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much is a DQ Dilly Bar?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The chocolate Dilly Bar is $1.99 with 210 calories. The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar is $2.49 with 220 calories."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is a Dilly Bar made of?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A round disc of DQ vanilla soft serve on a stick, coated in a crispy chocolate shell that hardens on contact with the cold ice cream."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is the DQ Non-Dairy Dilly Bar vegan?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar is made without dairy ingredients. Check with your local DQ or the DQ allergen guide for complete vegan verification, as manufacturing processes vary."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Dilly Bar — Price, Calories 2026" description="DQ Dilly Bar price: $1.99, 210 calories. Round DQ soft serve on a stick coated in crispy chocolate shell. The original DQ novelty bar since 1955.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/classic-treats">Classic Treats</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Dilly® Bar</span></li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/dilly-bar.webp" alt="Dilly® Bar — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">DQ Classic Since 1955</span><span class="badge">Best Value Bar</span><span class="badge blue">210 Calories</span></div>
      <h1>Dilly® Bar</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">$1.99</div>
      <p>A handcrafted disc of velvety vanilla soft serve perched on a classic wooden stick, flash-dipped in a delicate chocolate coating that instantly freezes into a snappy, crisp shell. First created in 1955, the legendary Dilly® Bar remains Dairy Queen's most iconic novelty treat—delivering pure vintage indulgence at an unbeatable $1.99 price point.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Price</td><td>Chocolate $1.99 · Non-Dairy $2.49</td></tr><tr><td>Calories</td><td>Chocolate 210 cal · Non-Dairy 220 cal</td></tr><tr><td>Format</td><td>Round disc on a stick</td></tr><tr><td>Shell</td><td>Crispy chocolate coating</td></tr><tr><td>On Menu Since</td><td>1955</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories by Size — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Dilly® Bar — Chocolate</strong></td><td>$1.99</td><td class="price-cell">210 cal</td><td>11g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Non-Dairy Dilly® Bar</strong></td><td>$2.49</td><td class="price-cell">220 cal</td><td>12g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DQ® Sandwich</strong></td><td>$1.49</td><td class="price-cell">190 cal</td><td>6g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Buster Bar® Treat</strong></td><td>$2.49</td><td class="price-cell">440 cal</td><td>28g</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Your local DQ may vary slightly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The DQ Dilly Bar — Seven Decades of Frozen Nostalgia</h2>
  <p>Debuting at an Illinois franchise in 1955, the Dilly® Bar stands among the longest-running novelty ice cream traditions in American quick-service history. Its signature magic comes down to physical contrast: biting through the wafer-thin, chilled chocolate shell produces an audible snap before yielding to the ultra-smooth, slow-melting vanilla soft serve core. Even after seven decades, this handheld favorite continues to anchor <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> as the ultimate nostalgic bargain at just $1.99.</p>
  <h2>Chocolate Dilly Bar vs. Non-Dairy Dilly Bar: Flavor & Dietary Breakdown</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th></th><th>Chocolate Dilly® Bar</th><th>Non-Dairy Dilly® Bar</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Price</td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Calories</td><td>210 cal</td><td>220 cal</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Inside</td><td>DQ vanilla soft serve</td><td>Dairy-free frozen dessert</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Coating</td><td>Crispy chocolate shell</td><td>Chocolatey coating (dairy-free)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Best for</td><td>All guests</td><td>Dairy-free or vegan guests</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>Insider Ordering Tips: When & How to Enjoy a Dilly Bar</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>The Perfect Post-Meal Palette Cleanser:</strong> Pairing hearty savory meals like a <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a> or savory <a href="/items/flamethrower-stackburger">Stackburger</a> with a Dilly Bar provides a sweet, portion-controlled dessert for just $1.99 without the heavy fullness of a large shake.</li>
    <li><strong>Mess-Free Handheld for Families:</strong> Thanks to the sturdy wooden stick and outer shell containing the soft serve, it is the premier travel-friendly choice for road trips and young kids compared to traditional drippy cake cones.</li>
    <li><strong>Inclusive Plant-Based Sweet Tooth:</strong> At $2.49, the Non-Dairy Dilly Bar offers guests with lactose sensitivities or vegan lifestyles a dedicated, certified dairy-free alternative that mirrors the classic chocolate crackle texture.</li>
  </ul>
