        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is a DQ Dilly Bar?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The chocolate Dilly Bar is $1.99 with 210 calories. The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar is $2.49 with 220 calories.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is a Dilly Bar made of?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
